  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of a Joint-SDG Programme with FAO and IFAD, the initiation plan is developed for UNDP&#x2019;s interventions in this Joint Programme (JP). It aims to explore entry points and cooperation opportunities for mobilization of greater support from international communities, which will be seeded with at least one project concept note through initial administrative and technical support to the establishment and operation of Food Systems Transformation Partnership (FSTP) and its working groups, especial</narrative>
